00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
One shot is all it takes

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Dear Wendy is a comedy, crime, drama film directed by Thomas Vinterberg.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
In a blue-collar American town, a group of teens bands together to form
the Dandies, a gang of gunslingers led by Dick Dandelion.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Following a code of strict pacifism at odds with the fact that they all carry guns, the group eventually lets in
Sebastian, the grandson of Dick's childhood nanny, Clarabelle, who fears the other gangs in the area.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Dick and company try to protect Clarabelle, but events
transpire that push the gang past posturing.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Dick Dandelion, played by Jamie Bell.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Krugsby, played by Bill Pullman.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Freddie, played by Michael Angarano.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Sebastian, played by Danso Gordon.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Clarabelle, played by Novella Nelson.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Huey, played by Chris Owen.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Dear Wendy is a 2005 crime film directed by Thomas
Vinterberg and written by Lars von Trier.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
It stars Jamie Bell, Bill Pullman, Michael Angarano, Mark
Webber, Danso Gordon, Novella Nelson and Alison Pill.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
It was an international co-production between Denmark, Germany, France,
and the United Kingdom, filmed on-location in Copenhagen.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film had its world premiere at the 2005 Sundance Film Festival.

16
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Vinterberg won the Silver St.

17
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
George for Best Director at the 27th Moscow International Film Festival.

18
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
The film explores themes of underdog, friendship,
secret society, west virginia, pacifist.

19
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
